          "description": "Generate a designer-grade UI mockup (pricing page, dashboard, settings, onboarding, marketing landing, mobile screen, form, modal, detail view, search results). Two modes (external_prompt_only / api); inline_svg is not supported (UI surfaces exceed the path budget). Routes by text density: gpt-image-2 default for text-heavy UI (pricing, dashboard, settings), Ideogram 3 Turbo for short-text mobile onboarding, Flux 2 Pro when 3+ refs need ordinal-indexed roles. Includes a [Surface job] slot per surface (comparison matrix on pricing, F-pattern on dashboards, ONE primary CTA on onboarding, grouped sections on settings). Bakes in anti-AI-slop guards (no Tailwind indigo, no purple gradient, no Inter headline, no rounded-card-with-left-stripe, no invented metrics, no lorem ipsum). Use this when the user asks",
